          "name": "EndpointDiscoveryService",
          "longName": "EndpointDiscoveryService",
          "fullName": "vigie.eds.v1.EndpointDiscoveryService",
          "description": "EndpointDiscoveryService gives the endpoints of the services Vigie is configured with. It answers the same endpoints\nas `GET /services`, on the same port and behind the same basic authentication.",
